<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 25.77 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 25.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell by 73 basis points to 25.77 percent on Wednesday, from 26.50 percent on Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The TIIP fell 190.46 basis points to 25.7787 percent on Wednesday from 27.6833 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
